-- Framing notes:
--   ★ THE KEYSTONE TYPE: Joseph is the great suffering-then-exalted type — rejected by his own, stripped, cast in the
--     pit, sold for silver, presumed dead, raised to the right hand of Egypt to save the very brethren who rejected
--     him. Read FORWARD to Yahusha (Jesus). Framed strictly as TYPE through the Formed-and-Formless lens (Red Line #4):
--     Joseph foreshadows the Formed Son later rejected and raised — NOT a flattening of the Son into a mere patriarch,
--     NOT co-equal-persons grammar. The shape (rejected-by-the-brethren, sold, presumed-dead, raised-to-save) is the type.
--   ★★ THREAD 6 IS THE SPINE: Acts 7:9-10 is the Spirit's OWN reading of Joseph through Stephen — *the patriarchs,
--     moved with envy, sold Joseph into Egypt: but Elohim (God) was with him, And delivered him out of all his
--     afflictions, and gave him favour and wisdom in the sight of Pharaoh... made him governor over Egypt.* The very
--     pattern (envy → sale → affliction → deliverance → exaltation) the chapter sets up. Genesis 50:20 is Joseph's
--     own naming of it: *ye thought evil against me; but Elohim (God) meant it unto good... to save much people alive.*
--     This thread is canon-only -> tier 'free'.
--   ★★ THE SILVER (THREAD 4): twenty pieces in Genesis 37:28; the type presses forward to Yahudah's (Judas') thirty in
--     Matthew 26:15 and back to Zechariah 11:12-13 — *they weighed for my price thirty pieces of silver... cast it
--     unto the potter.* Note Yahudah (Judah) is the brother who proposes the sale (v.26-27) — the lateral to the
--     betrayal is named without flattening: the brother sells the brother for silver, and the shepherd is priced.
--   ★ THE DREAMS (THREAD 2): the bowing sheaves and the sun/moon/eleven-stars are exaltation foretold — fulfilled
--     within the cycle (Genesis 42:6, the brethren bow) and pressed forward to Philippians 2:9-10 (every knee shall
--     bow). Revelation 12:1 (the woman clothed with the sun, the moon under her feet, a crown of twelve stars) reaches
--     back to the same Genesis-37 luminary imagery — the family of Yashar'el under sun/moon/twelve. (An existing
--     Revelation-12 thread already carries Rev 12:1; this is a distinct Genesis-37-source cross_reference row.)
--   ★ TWO-HOUSE WEAVE (THREAD 7): Joseph is the father of the NORTHERN house — *the stick of Joseph, the stick of
--     Ephraim* (Ezekiel 37:16,19), the birthright fallen to Joseph (1 Chronicles 5:1-2), Joseph among the sealed
--     (Revelation 7:8). The coat/dreams/birthright-favor of Genesis 37 establish the pre-eminence that becomes the
--     northern-house birthright: the rejected brother becomes the saved-and-saving house gathered with Yahudah into
--     one stick. Canon-only -> tier 'free'.
--   THE GOAT (THREAD 8): the kid of the goats killed and the coat dipped in its blood (Genesis 37:31) — Jubilees 34:18
--     binds this very goat to the origin of the Day of Atonement (the tenth of the seventh month, the afflicting of
--     souls, atonement with a young goat). Woven to Leviticus 16:5 / 23:27. A restored-witness etiology surfaced for
--     the lens; member thread is 'extras' (Jubilees present).
--   EXTRAS: Jasher 41-42 carry the extended Joseph-sold narrative verse-for-verse (clean parse — the pit, the sale,
--     the brothers, the twenty pieces). Jubilees 34 carries the sale into Egypt, the blood-dipped coat, the father's
--     mourning, and the Atonement etiology (clean parse). Jubilees DOUBLE-WRITTEN 'jubilees','jubilees'; Jasher
--     DOUBLE-WRITTEN 'jasher','jasher'. Jasher 41:22 frames the wandering-guide as *an angel of Yahuah (the Lord)* —
--     recorded for the lens (the Formed who appears/directs) but folded, not forced as a member.
--   VERSES WITH NO ADD: v.1-2 (setting/generations notice — folded into THREAD 1 witness, no distinct framework
